  "translation": "Long husat yu wanem i luk olsem, long glori na long biknem, namel long ol diwai bilong Eden? Na bai yu salim ⟨את⟩ ol diwai bilong Eden i go daun long graun daunbilo; namel long ol man i no kapsait skin bai yu slip wantaim ⟨את⟩ ol man ol bainat i kilim i dai pinis. Em i Parao, wantaim olgeta manmeri bilong em — tok bilong Adonai Yahwe.",
